  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{裁|さば}く\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{罪|つみ}→罪：03532_tsumi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{裁|さば}く: to judge a crime\n- ⟦{裁判|さいばん}→裁判：02773_saiban⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{裁|さば}く: to try in court\n- ⟦{神|かみ}→神：02147_kami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{裁|さば}く: God judges\n\nWATCH OUT:\nThe homophone ⟦{捌|さば}く→捌く：27532_sabaku⟧ means 'to handle skillfully' and 'to dress (a fish)': ⟦{仕事|しごと}→仕事：00480_shigoto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{捌|さば}く→捌く：27532_sabaku⟧, ⟦{注文|ちゅうもん}→注文：03485_chuumon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{捌|さば}く→捌く：27532_sabaku⟧, ⟦{魚|さかな}→魚：00499_sakana⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{捌|さば}く→捌く：27532_sabaku⟧. Do not write these with {裁|さば}く.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{裁判|さいばん}→裁判：02773_saiban⟧: trial, court case\n- ⟦{裁判官|さいばんかん}→裁判官：09562_saibankan⟧: judge",
